{"4192860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NEED: No End", "steam_appid": 4192860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/3825d88421c0e53fbf1d5d4b733f1c32.avif?t=1781805922\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras_big/3825d88421c0e53fbf1d5d4b733f1c32.avif?t=1781805922 width=1560 height=316 /></span><i> </i><br><br><i>The realm feels peaceful at first—soft wind, pale light, a quiet promise of safety.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But the moment you begin, that calm unravels</i>. The clock wakes, pressure rises, and every decision becomes a weight that shapes your survival.<br><br><strong>NEED is a strategic, pressure-driven survival management game built on tightly woven, multi-layered automation systems.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, upgrade, and sustain</strong> <strong>production loops.</strong> <strong>Assign workers, manage resources and decay</strong>, <strong>greet traders</strong>, <strong>fight smugglers</strong>, <strong>train Maesters</strong>, and hold the realm together as everything slowly strains against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It asks for calm focus in moments of chaos, and fast thinking when hesitation becomes a mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt—or collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/f4693b2a0923e4266b5bb6c2ee8a65f6.poster.avif?t=1781805922\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/f4693b2a0923e4266b5bb6c2ee8a65f6.webm?t=1781805922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/f4693b2a0923e4266b5bb6c2ee8a65f6.mp4?t=1781805922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A REALM THAT BREATHES WITH YOU</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realm shifts between heavy, shadowed moments and brief, fragile warmth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Its music moves with it—sometimes distant and hollow, sometimes gentle and reassuring.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It doesn’t command your attention; it simply settles around you, setting the tone for every choice you make.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/fe611df73b7973fcfee348fc5e2cd71f.poster.avif?t=1781805922\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/fe611df73b7973fcfee348fc5e2cd71f.webm?t=1781805922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/fe611df73b7973fcfee348fc5e2cd71f.mp4?t=1781805922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> HOW YOU SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with only a handful of resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assign workers</strong> to your early structures—Wheat, Mill, Bakery, Well, Forest, Quarry—and build the <strong>production loops</strong> that will keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong>, <strong>expand</strong>, and stabilize before decay takes hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Silo</strong> and <strong>KeepHut</strong> become your lifeline: <strong>Gatherers</strong> collecting <strong>Stacks</strong> and <strong>Keepers</strong> preventing collapse, repairing your fragile structures and holding them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traders</strong> bring opportunity—missions, bargains, and long-term bonds—while the <strong>Trap</strong> and its supply of Meat give you the <strong>Coins</strong> you need.<br>But where traders wander, smugglers follow. Build and upgrade the <strong>Tower</strong>, reinforce it under attack, or step in yourself when the realm is threatened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as your systems grow, the <strong>Maester’s Hall</strong> opens its doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, <strong>Maester Workers</strong> rise—specialists who elevate your loops, lighten your workforce, and push your realm toward self-sustaining balance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/e4148f80cdff8624475c5fd421054956.poster.avif?t=1781805922\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/e4148f80cdff8624475c5fd421054956.webm?t=1781805922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/e4148f80cdff8624475c5fd421054956.mp4?t=1781805922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>NEED’s FEATURES - Woven Into the Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interconnected stations, each contributing to a greater whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A decay system that never rests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workers, Keepers, Gatherers, and Maesters forming a living, layered ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automation loops</strong> that blossom as your realm grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading paths shaped by trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure that strikes the moment you become comfortable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEED is not only about lasting—it's about mastering the flow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every second is something you earn. Every mistake echoes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What do you do when the entire realm needs something from you?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the end, the realm remembers only one thing: how long you kept it alive, how long you kept it in need.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/3825d88421c0e53fbf1d5d4b733f1c32.avif?t=1781805922\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras_big/3825d88421c0e53fbf1d5d4b733f1c32.avif?t=1781805922 width=1560 height=316 /></span><i> </i><br><br><i>The realm feels peaceful at first—soft wind, pale light, a quiet promise of safety.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But the moment you begin, that calm unravels</i>. The clock wakes, pressure rises, and every decision becomes a weight that shapes your survival.<br><br><strong>NEED is a strategic, pressure-driven survival management game built on tightly woven, multi-layered automation systems.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, upgrade, and sustain</strong> <strong>production loops.</strong> <strong>Assign workers, manage resources and decay</strong>, <strong>greet traders</strong>, <strong>fight smugglers</strong>, <strong>train Maesters</strong>, and hold the realm together as everything slowly strains against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It asks for calm focus in moments of chaos, and fast thinking when hesitation becomes a mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt—or collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/extras/f4693b2a0