ss=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading paths shaped by trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure that strikes the moment you become comfortable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEED is not only about lasting—it's about mastering the flow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every second is something you earn. Every mistake echoes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What do you do when the entire realm needs something from you?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the end, the realm remembers only one thing: how long you kept it alive, how long you kept it in need.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Build and upgrade production loops, manage resources and workers, and expand your realm. Trade, adapt and survive hunger, pressure, decay, and threats in a tense, multi-layered strategy game where every choice matters.", "supported_languages": "English, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/752cf11abf68d61d9d42bdd6a9b2312c5824a9f9/header.jpg?t=1781805922", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/66c9b530cf767dcf1f1b381dc14958ea4b2ff974/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781805922", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192860/66c9b530cf767dcf1f1b381dc14958ea4b2ff974/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781805922", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 4GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SS